      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes. Analog “RT button“ on gamepad acts as “Interact button” and SHIFT+F2. SHIFT+F2 corresponds to angry emotion. Sometimes when I select something in the room using “RT button“, the angry emotion is on and I can’t remove it. SHIFT+F1 or any key combinations has no effect. My avatar is always angry :) I have to change the avatar to another and return it again in order to reset this emotion. So the “reset button” for avatar would be useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
