      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be nice as well even if it was just in the menu to have some sort of reload Avatar Button as often sitting down in a chair while the gesture is active will make that gesture stay stuck in whatever state it was when you entered",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
