      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Use Shift+F1 on overrided animation with shapekeys all set to 0. It will fix that. But if you use chair with any Gesture override(angry emote) and your avatar not have sitting animations(you use default) your emotes stuck again. Or try use any Emote from emotes menu, this action will be reset your animations.",
