      "value": "@{5b8ae9ce77dc2133df4db0fa|full_name}: that doesnt fix gestures. The more complex avatars i make do whole animations and mesh changes on gesture, or even rigid body tracking slides off after a while, the more advanced stuff like that gets stuck sometime and a simple refresh would help. Also, vr users dont have access to keyboards while playing.",
