      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since Main Menu 2.0 and still in build 1249 this issue has regressed, because \"Change into Avatar\" button is disabled when wearing it, and can't be used as a \"Refresh Avatar\" button. \nRefreshing the avatar is useful when uploading a new version, or when wanting to reload the avatar without resetting avatar parameters. Either the avatar change button should not be grayed out, or a separate \"Refresh/Reload Avatar\" button should be added. This would make sense in the new Quick Actions submenu in the Action Menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
